invocation:
Brigid of the bright flame, kindle my hearth;
Brigid of the well, wash my heart;
Brigid of the forge, temper my will;
Brigid of the poets, give tongue to what is still.
Mantle of green across the waking land,
keep this house within your hand.
Come in, Brigid, you are welcome here,
bless the threshold, the fire and all held dear.
